WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.900
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:35.020
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs & Migoto

01:39.380 --> 01:42.220
Joli-Coeur was hit by a horse cart and was seriously hurt.

01:43.590 --> 01:48.420
To save his life, we decided to take him to the doctor on the other side of the mountain.

01:50.000 --> 01:55.230
On our way over the snowy mountain, we were attacked by wolves.

02:03.850 --> 02:06.250
No. I can't believe it.

02:10.500 --> 02:14.200
Episode 13:
Farewell on a Snowy Day

02:34.020 --> 02:35.450
Joli-Coeur.

02:39.440 --> 02:40.480
Ahh...

02:40.880 --> 02:41.710
Remy.

02:42.200 --> 02:43.410
I'm all right.

02:44.010 --> 02:45.700
I'm sorry, Joli-Coeur.

02:49.230 --> 02:51.040
Hang in there, Remy.

02:51.100 --> 02:51.790
Yes.

03:04.680 --> 03:05.890
Mr. Vitalis.

03:06.690 --> 03:08.560
Yes, the end of the mountain.

03:08.690 --> 03:10.630
There must be a town nearby.

03:11.670 --> 03:14.780
Then... Then, we made it, right?

03:15.150 --> 03:19.740
Joli-Coeur, you're gonna be all right. We'll get you to the doctor soon.

03:52.400 --> 03:54.100
Capi, what's wrong?

04:07.850 --> 04:09.510
They won't come.

04:09.640 --> 04:12.700
Dolce and Zerbino aren't coming back.

04:19.380 --> 04:21.340
You miss your friends?

04:22.030 --> 04:23.480
So do I.

04:52.090 --> 04:57.360
Dolce, Zerbino... I'm sorry...
I'm sorry.

05:01.750 --> 05:02.760
Remy.

05:05.270 --> 05:06.730
Mr. Vitalis.

05:10.450 --> 05:14.600
Zerbino and Dolce saved our lives.

05:15.260 --> 05:18.430
Thanks to them, we were able to cross over the mountain.

05:18.670 --> 05:22.290
Their deaths weren't a waste.

05:26.410 --> 05:29.890
I should have taken better care of them.

05:30.620 --> 05:33.220
I should have been more kind to them.

05:36.790 --> 05:39.370
Dolce and Zerbino understood you very well.

05:39.940 --> 05:41.530
They loved you.

05:56.960 --> 05:58.390
Aghh!

06:00.350 --> 06:02.430
Mr. Vitalis, what's wrong?

06:04.190 --> 06:05.420
I'm all right.

06:05.510 --> 06:07.320
I'll feel better if I stay still.

06:08.000 --> 06:10.030
I'll go find somebody.

06:10.910 --> 06:12.030
Remy.

06:13.620 --> 06:15.720
Go to the town.

06:15.760 --> 06:16.620
Ehhh?

06:16.620 --> 06:19.020
Take Joli-Coeur to the doctor.

06:20.540 --> 06:21.760
But…

06:21.870 --> 06:23.300
The money's in here.

06:23.410 --> 06:25.610
With this money, take Joli-Coeur-

06:26.320 --> 06:27.880
Mr. Vitalis!

06:30.000 --> 06:33.390
Mr. Vitalis, are you all right? Mr. Vitalis.

06:34.340 --> 06:36.770
I'm all right. Now go.

06:36.790 --> 06:38.510
I'll come later.

06:40.120 --> 06:45.980
And Capi will be with me.

06:48.600 --> 06:50.960
- Now, Remy.
- Yes.

06:57.530 --> 06:59.030
Go now.

07:05.580 --> 07:07.430
Take care of Joli-Coeur.

07:47.170 --> 07:49.810
We'll be there soon, Joli-Coeur. Soon.

08:03.100 --> 08:04.400
Joli-Coeur.

08:07.670 --> 08:11.630
- Doctor, how is Joli-Coeur?
- He's all right. He'll survive.

08:11.630 --> 08:12.160
Huhhhh....

08:12.890 --> 08:14.680
It's good that you brought him so quickly.

08:18.030 --> 08:23.430
Good, Joli-Coeur.
You did a great job, a great job.

08:27.720 --> 08:29.030
Joli-Coeur.

08:32.400 --> 08:33.940
Joli-Coeur.

08:37.620 --> 08:39.800
He needs to stay here.

08:40.600 --> 08:41.590
Stay here?

08:41.630 --> 08:47.230
Unfortunately, he has to stay here and lie quietly in bed for a while.

09:04.870 --> 09:06.890
Mr. Vitalis!

09:13.060 --> 09:15.490
You came to meet me?

09:17.300 --> 09:19.170
Joli-Coeur will survive.

09:19.350 --> 09:23.560
- There's no broken bones. He'll be fine.
- I see.

09:23.560 --> 09:24.900
We made it.

09:25.230 --> 09:27.680
Mr. Vitalis. I'm so glad.

09:27.680 --> 09:29.570
So glad.

09:29.620 --> 09:34.690
But... But I feel sorry for Dolce and Zerbino.

09:51.040 --> 09:53.710
I spent all the money.

09:54.920 --> 09:58.270
I was told we have to let him stay in the hospital.

09:58.980 --> 10:00.120
I see.

10:00.430 --> 10:02.680
What are we going to do now?

10:02.680 --> 10:06.450
We have no money and we can't perform a show without them.

10:08.960 --> 10:12.470
While Joli-Coeur is in the hospital, let's go to Paris.

10:12.730 --> 10:14.760
Paris is not far from here.

10:14.760 --> 10:15.730
Paris?

10:16.260 --> 10:19.020
We can perform shows there even in the winter time.

10:19.260 --> 10:21.020
I also have an acquaintance in Paris.

10:21.810 --> 10:22.470
Yes.

10:22.940 --> 10:25.650
- Keep moving forward, Remy.
- Yes.

10:27.520 --> 10:29.770
Aggh!

10:32.610 --> 10:33.940
Mr. Vitalis?

10:35.150 --> 10:36.820
Remy...

10:49.060 --> 10:50.070
Mr. Vitalis?

11:15.460 --> 11:16.480
Remy.

11:16.960 --> 11:18.220
Mr. Vitalis?

11:19.210 --> 11:22.140
- You've regained consciousness?
- I got some sleep, didn't I?

11:22.160 --> 11:22.960
Yes.

11:23.880 --> 11:26.170
I feel better now.

11:26.810 --> 11:29.170
- Good.
- Remy.

11:31.180 --> 11:35.780
I shouldn't have taken you with me.

11:36.730 --> 11:40.660
I should've left you with Mrs. Milligan.

11:41.070 --> 11:43.760
I want to stay with you, Mr. Vitalis.

11:51.700 --> 11:53.020
Capi, come here.

11:55.890 --> 12:01.260
While Mr. Vitalis was sleeping, I came up with a good idea.

12:01.260 --> 12:02.520
A good idea?

12:02.630 --> 12:05.250
We're heading to Paris, right?

12:05.250 --> 12:06.420
Yes.

12:06.420 --> 12:11.450
When we get to Paris, you could play the violin and I could sing.

12:11.620 --> 12:16.780
And when we make a lot of money we could buy some new dogs.

12:17.550 --> 12:18.720
Dogs?

12:20.820 --> 12:21.740
Remy.

12:22.780 --> 12:27.650
Can I name the new dogs Dolce and Zerbino?

12:28.990 --> 12:31.860
Yes… That's a good idea.

12:31.860 --> 12:33.860
Oh, great!

12:34.150 --> 12:36.020
I'll cherish them very much.

12:36.350 --> 12:39.820
And I'll help you teach them some new games. Yes and...

12:39.820 --> 12:43.800
We'll buy a new cart and a donkey and build a new Vitalis Troupe.

12:43.800 --> 12:48.320
I'll do my best. And Capi and Joli-Coeur will do their best too.

12:48.320 --> 12:50.060
I'm sure it'll go well.

12:50.860 --> 12:52.560
Who are you?

12:54.080 --> 12:56.460
Who let you in here?

12:56.460 --> 12:59.370
Sorry. We were just taking a rest.

12:59.370 --> 13:01.090
Get out of here, now.

13:01.530 --> 13:03.220
I'm very cautious about strangers.

13:03.510 --> 13:06.200
Please. Just let us rest until morning.

13:06.200 --> 13:07.870
It's snowing very hard outside.

13:07.870 --> 13:09.290
Shut up!

13:09.680 --> 13:10.540
Remy.

13:10.890 --> 13:12.170
Please!

13:12.170 --> 13:14.690
No, no! Get out of here now!

13:37.430 --> 13:39.280
Mr. Vitalis, are you all right?

13:41.860 --> 13:42.570
Yes…

13:42.790 --> 13:47.590
It's impossible to get to Paris right now. It's better to lodge somewhere.

13:47.810 --> 13:49.860
No… Let's go now.

14:00.420 --> 14:02.960
- Paris is just over there.
- Paris?

14:12.480 --> 14:13.580
This is Paris.

14:15.100 --> 14:15.980
It's beautiful.

14:16.620 --> 14:19.930
This is where you were picked up by Barberin, isn't it?

14:19.930 --> 14:22.600
Yes. That's what my mother told me.

14:24.450 --> 14:28.720
I wonder if my real mother and father live here.

14:29.010 --> 14:32.120
I don't know. But don't give up hope.

14:32.490 --> 14:35.420
You will see your real parents someday.

14:35.420 --> 14:39.060
Really, Mr. Vitalis? You really think so?

14:39.060 --> 14:39.900
Yes.

14:44.900 --> 14:50.060
My mother and father…
I might see them in this city.

14:55.940 --> 14:58.060
- Remy?
- Yes.

14:58.350 --> 15:00.900
If something happens to me...

15:03.310 --> 15:07.430
I'm old and my heart has weakened.

15:07.430 --> 15:10.780
Nothing will happen. You'll be all right…

15:13.600 --> 15:14.750
You'll be all right.

15:20.280 --> 15:25.350
If something happens to me, go to Gaspard in Paris.

15:25.520 --> 15:30.150
He lives on Groussinou Avenue. He's old, but a nice man.

15:30.150 --> 15:32.290
No, don't say that.

15:32.290 --> 15:37.360
I'm staying with you, Mr. Vitalis. If we go to Paris, everything will be okay again.

15:44.330 --> 15:46.270
- Let's go.
- Yes.

16:12.800 --> 16:14.060
Mr. Vitalis?

16:14.500 --> 16:18.140
- I'm a bit tired. I'm going to take a break.
- Okay.

16:30.750 --> 16:33.320
If we stay here, we'll freeze.

16:33.320 --> 16:35.240
It's beautiful here.

16:46.770 --> 16:49.040
It feels so good.

16:50.100 --> 16:54.370
I've been traveling alone for a long time.

16:54.570 --> 16:59.640
Since that one incident, I've hated to live with other people.

16:59.640 --> 17:01.740
Since then, I've been alone.

17:01.740 --> 17:04.820
My only friends were the animals.

17:06.980 --> 17:10.000
It was so great to travel with you.

17:10.200 --> 17:14.960
Remy, you comforted my heart, one that had pushed others away.

17:15.420 --> 17:24.550
Mr. Vitalis, you saved my life.
I love you very much, Mr. Vitalis.

17:32.590 --> 17:35.770
I can't live anymore.

17:37.690 --> 17:40.270
Go to Paris by yourself.

17:40.270 --> 17:43.090
No, no. Please don't say that.

17:44.760 --> 17:49.990
I wanted to look for your parents when we got to Paris.

17:49.990 --> 17:52.740
It's all right. I don't care about that.

17:52.850 --> 17:58.600
I'm happy with you, Mr. Vitalis. You're my family.

18:01.510 --> 18:02.220
Remy.

18:13.110 --> 18:17.650
God... Please protect Remy.

18:24.770 --> 18:26.020
Mr. Vitalis.

18:27.990 --> 18:31.270
Death is painful, but it doesn't mean goodbye.

18:32.660 --> 18:35.280
I used to have someone to love.

18:36.190 --> 18:41.140
But the two of us had to separate from each other.

18:42.030 --> 18:54.060
That person still lives on in my heart. Even after my death, I will always...

18:54.370 --> 18:57.520
live on in your heart forever.

19:01.490 --> 19:07.770
Dolce and Zerbino will live on in you forever.

19:09.180 --> 19:15.680
Death will never be a separation.

19:15.770 --> 19:18.150
No, please don't say such a thing.

19:19.610 --> 19:23.530
Mr. Vitalis, wake up.
Don't fall asleep here.

19:24.210 --> 19:25.580
Mr. Vitalis.

19:26.550 --> 19:31.250
Zerbino and Dolce are coming to take me.

20:07.260 --> 20:10.520
No, no. Please don't leave me alone.

20:16.850 --> 20:21.060
Mr. Vitalis, wake up!
Please wake up. Mr. Vitalis!

20:23.640 --> 20:24.940
Remy.

20:33.600 --> 20:34.480
What is it?

20:41.690 --> 20:44.530
Mr. Vitalis… What's wrong?

20:45.350 --> 20:47.420
Wake up or you'll freeze.

20:47.750 --> 20:51.230
Mr. Vitalis, please open your eyes.

20:51.230 --> 20:53.130
Please, look at me.

21:04.330 --> 21:08.510
Mr. Vitalis, we're going to Paris together.

21:08.510 --> 21:10.630
We have to keep moving forward.

21:11.030 --> 21:19.010
You promised to go to Paris, and buy dogs and build a new troupe.

21:19.010 --> 21:23.790
We'll all perform together again…

21:29.170 --> 21:33.050
Please don't leave me alone.

21:34.150 --> 21:37.370
Please don't die, don't die…

21:48.010 --> 21:56.190
Try to love yourself more

21:57.760 --> 22:07.010
Abandoned dreams can be seen again

22:07.300 --> 22:15.740
Surely, not everyone can be so strong

22:16.960 --> 22:27.870
The blue sky lifts all of the world's tears...

22:28.370 --> 22:38.000
Tomorrow's courage comes

22:38.270 --> 22:48.010
From the future that gives us our fate

22:48.190 --> 22:56.920
Try to seek for them more

22:57.820 --> 23:01.520
Give your heart to

23:01.720 --> 23:16.930
That person who is also seeking you

23:18.560 --> 23:20.610
Goodbye, Mr. Vitalis.

23:20.960 --> 23:22.790
I will go to Paris.

23:23.100 --> 23:25.680
Don't worry, I won't cry anymore.

23:27.380 --> 23:28.440
Could this be the place?

23:30.110 --> 23:32.800
Hello… Where's Mr. Gaspard?

23:33.630 --> 23:36.800
<i>Beginning of a New Journey</i>

23:33.630 --> 23:36.800
Next time:
